{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27315","headline":"留题桂州碧浔亭 · 韦瓘","name":"留题桂州碧浔亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"半年领郡固无劳，一日爲心素所操。\n轮奂未成绳墨在，规模已壮闶闳高。\n理人虽切才常短，薄宦都缘命不遭。\n从此归耕洛川上，大千江路任风涛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦瓘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27315.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27315","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}